      "headline": "The bread or the key?",
      "title": "The bread or the key? Everyone sees this a little different. The explanation I like the most is the bread is tangible. He can grab it, and it feeds him straight away. It's the quick, safe… | Ahroon Santhosh | 14 comments",
      "post_text": "The bread or the key?\n\nEveryone sees this a little different.\n\nThe explanation I like the most is the bread is tangible. He can grab it, and it feeds him straight away. It's the quick, safe choice.\n\nThe key is the unknown. Who knows what happens once that door swings open? Is it a risk your willing to take?\n\nHaving a startup feels the same way. Stepping into the unknown, unaware of all the hurdles that were coming up. Having to learn things on the go we didn't even know existed.\n\nIt's not for everybody, that's for sure. But hey, I'm more than willing to take the risk.\n\nEveryday is something new to tackle, and I love that.\n\np.s the loaf of bread showing its worth in gold again  iykyk, check the kriosfounders insta ;)",
