      "headline": "Do random side quests with your team.",
      "title": "Do random side quests with your team. Abraham and I hiked Carrountoohill at 4am the other day. Michael got scared and didn't come 🥲 These bonding moments, where we were looking at the mountains… | Ahroon Santhosh | 18 comments",
      "post_text": "Do random side quests with your team.\n\n\nAbraham and I hiked Carrountoohill at 4am the other day. Michael got scared and didn't come 🥲\n\nThese bonding moments, where we were looking at the mountains, and just discussing life, mean more than you might think.\n\nIt's important to step back from business and just say, 'how you been recently'. \n\nWe're founders yes, but also friends, and we gotta remember that sometimes.\n\nCheck up on the people around you 🫡\n\np.s check out the view too",
