      "headline": "These moments>",
      "title": "These moments> Kríos was made like this. Just us 3, meeting up and having laidback conversation, or so it seemed. The work was mainly done during the night, but our daily meetups are almost just as… | Ahroon Santhosh",
      "post_text": "These moments>\n\nKríos was made like this. Just us 3, meeting up and having laidback conversation, or so it seemed.\n\nThe work was mainly done during the night, but our daily meetups are almost just as essential.\n\nThis is when we  bounce ideas, compare what we've been working on and tackle any new issues that have come up.\n\nKríos is not one person. It's all 3 of us. Michael, Abraham and myself.\n\nWe're constantly in touch with each other, keeping Kríos on the right track.\n\nThat's why we move as fast as we do.",
